OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners 'disappointed' by
OL,4,Avineyard homes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have said they are
OL,7,F"extremely disappointed" vineyards
OL,8,Fcould be developed to meet the demand
OL,9,Ffor homes on Guernsey.
OL,11,FThe island's Development and Planning
OL,12,FAuthority (DPA) has approved new sites
OL,13,Ffor 267 homes.
OL,15,FThe development locations, agreed at a
OL,16,Fmeeting on Tuesday, include Les Caches
OL,17,Ffarm in St Pierre Du Bois, land at
OL,18,FSandy Hook in St Sampson, the Whispers
OL,19,FVinery in Castel and the Regency
OL,20,Fvineyard in St Martins.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
