OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners 'disappointed' by
OL,4,Avineyard homes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer deputy Rob Prow said the Save
OL,7,FSteam Mill Lane group were "extremely
OL,8,Fdisappointed" by the decision. He said:
OL,9,F"There appears now to be no red lines
OL,10,Faround damage to the environment and
OL,11,Ftraffic danger."
